Description: isolated GXDE KWin window manager for X11
 This package provides the GXDE fork of the KWin X11 window manager. Its
 executable, libraries, plugins, configuration files, D-Bus metadata and
 runtime data use a GXDE-specific namespace so that it can be installed next
 to the distribution KWin packages.
 .
 It deliberately does not ship a KWin Wayland compositor executable.
 .
 It also contains the GXDE/Deepin window manager compatibility layer from
 gxde-wm-shim: the com.deepin.wm D-Bus service used by the GXDE desktop, hot
 zone and shortcut scripts, and GXDE default settings and window rules.

Package: libgxde-kwin-x11-6
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: isolated GXDE KWin X11 shared library
 This package contains the versioned shared library used by gxde-kwin_x11.
 It has a GXDE-specific SONAME and can coexist with the distribution KWin
 library.

